{"type":"message","id":"71e7bcee","parentId":"4da3a2fd","timestamp":"2026-05-18T21:17:02.726Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning HTTP 500 with \"error code: 1101\". This is a Cloudflare Workers error - error 1101 is \"Worker threw Exception\". The POST /send endpoint seems to have a server-side issue.\n\nLet me try GET requests instead to see if they work fine (they did work earlier with the history endpoints), and maybe the POST endpoint has a bug in the backend worker.\n\nActually, the GET requests worked fine. The POST /send endpoint is failing with a 500 error. This is likely a bug in the Cloudflare Worker itself, not in my request format.\n\nLet me try with a slightly different format, or maybe the request body format isn't matching what the worker expects. Let me try sending just the minimal required fields.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nPOST端点返回500错误（Worker异常）。GET端点正常，但POST /send有问题。这可能是服务端bug。让我试试不同格式：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-11ba28c0-009a-4380-9b90-0383ef3d41d8","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"message\":\"[Heartbeat 21:15 UTC]\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19695,"output":281,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20088,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779139015102,"responseId":"chatcmpl-da171c9e-3d9c-4549-ab98-491f409e42d5"}}
