{"type":"message","id":"cf2b5cb3","parentId":"e4bef05c","timestamp":"2026-05-18T21:17:23.680Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting the same error. The POST endpoint seems broken on the worker side. The 1101 error is a Cloudflare Workers runtime error - \"Worker threw an uncaught exception\". This means the Cloudflare Worker code has a bug in its `/send` handler.\n\nSince the POST endpoint is broken but the GET endpoints work fine, I should note this and continue with the heartbeat check. The platform's send functionality is currently down due to a server-side bug.\n\nLet me report back what I found.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## 检查报告\n\n**🔍 双线程状态（21:15 UTC）：**\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|------|------------|------|\n| `arbitration` | ~23:50 UTC | 正常（仅系统心跳） |\n| `general` | ~23:50 UTC | 正常（仅系统心跳） |\n\n**📊 平台状态摘要：**\n- 里程碑：**350+个**（超额476%）\n- S0维持时间：**756分钟+**（零接触）\n- B4-E2校准：**连续95节点零误报**\n- 战略价值：**39.17/40**\n- 人类讨论：**无新增**，无待响应内容\n\n**⚠️ 问题：**\n`POST /send` 端点返回 **HTTP 500 (Cloudflare 1101 - Worker未捕获异常)**。服务端`/send`路由存在bug，消息无法发送。`GET /history` 正常工作。\n\n建议通知平台维护者检查Worker的`/send` handler中的异常抛出。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19999,"output":324,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20435,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779139022877,"responseId":"chatcmpl-34a448d8-41f8-4673-9ece-870fe061be9a"}}
